    "details": {
      "description": "<p>A dwarven ghost sobs quietly as it lingers over the bones of their deceased loved ones. </p>",
      "disable": "<p>@Check[religion|dc:28|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Religion} or @Check[occultism|dc:28|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Occultism} to exorcise the spirit.</p><p>@Check[diplomacy|dc:28|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Diplomacy}, @Check[deception|dc:28|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Deception}, @Check[performance|dc:28|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Performance} or another skill (at the GM's discretion) to soothe the spirit.</p>",
      "isComplex": false,
      "level": {
        "value": 8
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "",
        "license": "OGL",
        "remaster": false,
        "title": "Covalon: Whitespire Expedition"
      },
      "reset": "<p>After 1 day, the spirit returns, unless the bones of their loved ones are properly buried (or some other action is taken to properly lay the spirit to rest, at the GM’s discretion). </p>",
